# Custom SC2 dictionary for IDEs

# PyCharm:
## Settings -> Editor -> Natural Languages -> Spelling -> Add Custom dictionary

# Visual Studio:
## Create or open an .editorconfig file in your solution's root or project folder.
## add `spelling_exclusion_path = .\sc2ai_dictionary.dic`
## add `sc2ai_dictionary.dic` to the same folder as `.editorconfig`


